  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "2. Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "3. Add the diced potato, sliced carrot, and chopped celery. Cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "4. Add the garlic powder and thyme. Stir to combine.",
    "5. Add the stew and bring to a boil.",
    "6. Reduce heat to low and add the cod. Cover and simmer for 8-10 minutes, or until the cod is cooked through.",
    "7. Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "8. Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
